# The icons tools/build_icon_set.py compiles into the firmware by default.
#
# Names only, from the openHAB classic icon set; the artwork is fetched at
# build time (see doc/icon-set.md). A general list for typical home
# automation sitemaps, not for one installation. An icon that is not here
# still works: the panel fetches it from the openHAB server over HTTP.
#
#   name    the icon and all its state variants (name-on, name-open, name-40)
#   =name   this one record only, to keep a numeric ladder in steps of 20
#
# Keep or drop a family as a whole. The panel takes any built-in match and
# does not ask the server then: a base icon without its named variants
# draws the base icon for every state. A thinned ladder must keep its -0.
#
# One line or several names per line; text after # is a comment.

# Lighting
light                         # on/off and 0-100 in tens, kept whole
lightbulb colorlight colorpicker colorwheel rgb outdoorlight
=slider =slider-0 =slider-20 =slider-40 =slider-60 =slider-80 =slider-100

# Switches and outlets
switch wallswitch poweroutlet

# Blinds, rollershutters, garage doors
rollershutter                 # 0-100 in tens, kept whole
=blinds =blinds-0 =blinds-20 =blinds-40 =blinds-60 =blinds-80 =blinds-100
=garagedoor =garagedoor-ajar =garagedoor-closed =garagedoor-open
=garagedoor-0 =garagedoor-20 =garagedoor-40 =garagedoor-60 =garagedoor-80 =garagedoor-100

# Heating, temperature, air
temperature temperature_cold temperature_hot
heating radiator climate
=humidity =humidity-0 =humidity-20 =humidity-40 =humidity-60 =humidity-80 =humidity-100
fan fan_ceiling pressure carbondioxide

# Windows, doors, contacts, locks
window door frontdoor contact lock

# Presence, motion, security
presence motion siren shield fire
alarm smoke camera

# Energy, power, battery, utilities
energy solarplant price gas water
=battery =battery-0 =battery-20 =battery-40 =battery-60 =battery-80 =battery-100
=batterylevel =batterylevel-0 =batterylevel-20 =batterylevel-40 =batterylevel-60 =batterylevel-80 =batterylevel-100
lowbattery

# Media
player mediacontrol video
soundvolume soundvolume_mute receiver screen

# Weather and time
sun sun_clouds rain snow wind moon sunrise sunset calendar time

# Appliances
washingmachine whitegood

# Rooms and floors
house groundfloor firstfloor cellar attic garden garage kitchen
bedroom bath toilet office corridor sofa terrace

# System, network, generic
network settings status error none text group chart
